---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import experience from '../data/experience.json';
interface Props {id?:string;}
const {id='workflow'}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="workflow-section wrap section" data-tabs><div class="section-header reveal"><span class="eyebrow">CONTEXT INTO ACTION</span><h2>The whole story.<br/>A better next move.</h2><p>Move from “something looks wrong” to “here’s the change to review.”</p></div><div class="workflow-layout reveal"><div class="workflow-steps" role="tablist" aria-label="Connected security workflow">{experience.workflow.map((step,i)=><button class:list={['workflow-tab',{active:i===0}]} id={`${id}-tab-${i}`} role="tab" aria-selected={i===0?'true':'false'} aria-controls={`${id}-panel-${i}`} tabindex={i===0?0:-1} data-tab={i}><span class="step-index">0{i+1}</span><span><strong>{step.label}</strong><span>{step.summary}</span></span><Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={18}/></button>)}</div><div class="workflow-panels">{experience.workflow.map((step,i)=><div id={`${id}-panel-${i}`} role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby={`${id}-tab-${i}`} data-panel={i} hidden={i!==0}><div class:list={['workflow-visual',`workflow-visual-${i}`]}>
{i===0&&<div class="mini-risk"><div class="mini-risk-header"><Icon name="route" size={19}/><span>Connected exposure</span><span class="review-label">Sample path</span></div><div class="mini-route"><span><Icon name="cloud" size={28}/><strong>web-production</strong></span><div class="mini-route-line"></div><span class="orange"><Icon name="key" size={28}/><strong>deployment-role</strong></span><div class="mini-route-line"></div><span><Icon name="database" size={28}/><strong>critical-secrets</strong></span></div><div class="mini-risk-note"><Icon name="info-circle" size={15}/>Three findings. One relationship to review.</div></div>}
{i===1&&<div class="identity-preview"><div class="identity-preview-head"><span class="identity-avatar"><Icon name="fingerprint" size={32}/></span><div><span class="meta">MACHINE IDENTITY · SAMPLE</span><h3>deployment-role</h3><p>Owner: Platform engineering</p></div></div><div class="identity-grant"><span>Permission</span><code>secrets:GetValue</code></div><div class="identity-grant"><span>Resource</span><strong>production/secrets/*</strong></div><div class="identity-grant"><span>Evidence</span><strong>Observed policy scope</strong></div><div class="identity-insight"><Icon name="bulb" size={18}/>A broad grant meets a sensitive target.</div></div>}
{i===2&&<div class="change-preview"><div class="change-preview-head"><Icon name="git-pull-request" size={21}/><strong>Scope the deployment role</strong><span class="review-label">Proposed</span></div><div class="code-preview"><span class="code-remove">− Resource: "production/secrets/*"</span><span class="code-add">+ Resource: "application/config"</span><span class="code-comment">// Illustrative scope change</span></div><div class="change-approval"><span class="avatar-square">PE</span><div><strong>Platform engineering</strong><span>Review dependencies before rollout</span></div><Icon name="check" size={18}/></div><div class="mini-risk-note"><Icon name="info-circle" size={15}/>Human approval. Normal testing. Fresh verification.</div></div>}
</div><div class="workflow-panel-copy"><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.description}</p><a class="text-link" href={`/${step.link}/`}>{step.linkLabel}<Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={16}/></a></div></div>)}</div></div></section>
